<title>USA: Interstate Hotels buys Pittsburgh Marriott.</title>
<headline>Interstate Hotels buys Pittsburgh Marriott.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interstate Hotels Co said Wednesday it has acquired Pittsburgh Airport Marriott in Pittsburgh, Pa. for $33.4 million.</p>
<p>Interstate developed the hotel in 1987 and has been managing the 314-room property since its opening.</p>
